{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/f409e7a94cf36c088684b2346c6859ac.apng?t=1760033635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/f409e7a94cf36c088684b2346c6859ac.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mysteries of a lost civilization</strong> in this creature-collecting adventure. <strong>Inscribe your findings</strong> into a bestiary, a tome with the forgotten lore of Yselion and its creatures. With every entry, you draw closer to the truth behind the fallen empire and the Beasts that roam its ruins. Hatch, train, and forge deep bonds with unique Beasts as you face the <strong>legendary Star Trials, only the fittest will endure.\u00a0Every Adult Beast can be ridden!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/cf641c7353aab84eab0ff9a017561ea4.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/cf641c7353aab84eab0ff9a017561ea4.webm?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/cf641c7353aab84eab0ff9a017561ea4.mp4?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/470873d04bf443811eb8027474dca127.apng?t=1760033635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/470873d04bf443811eb8027474dca127.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise over\u00a0100 Fully Animated Beasts, </strong>train them and as you guide their evolution into <strong>powerful paragons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/bbefdb24eb6824fd9ffd26beb70a46ef.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/bbefdb24eb6824fd9ffd26beb70a46ef.webm?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/bbefdb24eb6824fd9ffd26beb70a46ef.mp4?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Beast follows a unique path, shaped by your choices and raising. Will your companion become a <strong>ruthless Tyrant, a noble Monarch, or a cunning Archon?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/f6b7d5fa92ed271ced97432542199bcf.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/f6b7d5fa92ed271ced97432542199bcf.webm?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/f6b7d5fa92ed271ced97432542199bcf.mp4?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/a506256a4ecc0b53f8ec628d0f0922ae.apng?t=1760033635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/a506256a4ecc0b53f8ec628d0f0922ae.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into an untamed, open world <strong>teeming with secrets and lurking dangers</strong>. <strong>Chart your own path</strong>\u00a0riding your Beasts through perilous landscapes, but beware, one wrong step could bring you face to face with <strong>something far more dangerous than you ever imagined</strong>. Your Beasts will be there to protect you from your enemies. Use your knowledge and instincts to choose the right skills at the right time and use the confrontations to dominate your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.webm?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/000546b3e3009a2e31abf8fc16e9f07e.mp4?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/0e0b73b16b60be158fb5ef35d19b8b07.apng?t=1760033635\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/0e0b73b16b60be158fb5ef35d19b8b07.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beasts are more than just companions, they are <strong>part of an eternal cycle</strong>. As they pass away, the power they've acquired lives on, stored within mysterious orbs that can be absorbed by other Beasts. Through this <strong>endless flow of hearts and souls</strong>, the next generation grows ever stronger. <strong>Death is not the end, it is only the next step in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.poster.avif?t=1760033635\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.webm?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/extras/1b475faf85a7a5033e7bda01e143059b.mp4?t=1760033635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo is out! Wishlist the game and follow to not miss any updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529090?t=1760033635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760033635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760033635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529090/e915eb354dd127331045a378d7ddc3e0b7983db4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760033635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3675910,"description